msgid "Policy"
msgstr "Konduto"

#: cache.cpp:83
msgid "&Keep cache in sync"
msgstr "&Sinkronigu tenejon"

#: cache.cpp:86
msgid ""
"Select this if you want to verify whether the page cached in your hard disk "
"is still valid."
msgstr ""

#: cache.cpp:99
#, fuzzy
msgid "Use cache whenever &possible"
msgstr "&Uzu tenejon se eble"

#: cache.cpp:103
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Enable this to always use documents from the cache when available. You can "
"still use the reload button to synchronize the cache with the remote host."
